  + (f": the mean taxonomic AUCs changed from {r5get('taxa mean AUC (main)')} to {_sens} (raw / synthetic-only / combined), and {_sj.split('/')[2].split('(')[0].strip()} of the stable combined-model pairs of the main analysis were recovered ({_sj.split('/')[0].strip()} main, {_sj.split('/')[1].strip()} sensitivity run; Supplementary Table 8), while the hub structure persisted ({r5get('P. micra / F. nucleatum stable combined pairs').split(' vs ')[1]} stable combined-model pairs for P. micra / F. nucleatum versus {r5get('P. micra / F. nucleatum stable combined pairs').split(' vs ')[0]} in the main analysis). The classification results and the hub species are thus robust to the training-set composition, whereas the identity of individual stable pairs is not, and we now present the stable-pair lists as representative members of a larger family of informative pairs rather than as a definitive catalogue" if _sens else " (Supplementary Table 8)")
