  + ". We note that a multiplicative term on the logit scale and the interaction information measure different departures from additivity, and that the two sets of pairs need not coincide; both are reported. We have also toned down the claim that the pairs are inaccessible to conventional methods: the constituents of most pairs are themselves disease-associated, and what the framework adds is the resolution of which partner carries the joint signal and in what form.",
